DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Destin Fishing Rodeo: Daily Public Weigh-Ins
DESCRIPTION:Anglers competing in the month-long Destin Fishing Rodeo bring
  their catches to the scale on the harbor docks behind AJ's Seafood & Oys
 ter Bar every day in October. The public is welcome to watch for free fro
